# ── Build context: parent dir (contains .devcontainer/, code-repo/, specs-repo/) ─
# Allowlist approach: exclude everything, then explicitly permit what the
# Dockerfile needs. Only Dockerfile and .zshrc need to reach the image.
# specs-repo/ is excluded implicitly — nothing below allows it back in.

*
!.devcontainer/Dockerfile
!.devcontainer/.zshrc
!.devcontainer/check-exclusions.sh
!.devcontainer/claude-wrapper.sh
!ki-zfw-wm-code/bitmarck-ca-chain.crt
!ki-zfw-wm-code/pyproject.toml
!ki-zfw-wm-code/uv.lock
!ki-zfw-wm-code/README.md
!ki-zfw-wm-code/.pre-commit-config.yaml